<td id="S5.T2.5.16.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">5219 (x0.85)</td>
<td id="S5.T2.5.16.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">2695 (x0.76)</td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T2.5.17" class="ltx_tr">
